&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role will be as part of&amp;nbsp;the Product Test and Diagnosis&amp;nbsp;team, which is part of the&amp;nbsp;Graphcore&amp;nbsp;Manufacturing Operations department and has members in Bristol, Cambridge, India,&amp;nbsp;US&amp;nbsp;and Taiwan. The team&amp;nbsp;is responsible for&amp;nbsp;definition, development, and execution of an end-to-end test strategy spanning silicon, board-level assemblies, server blades, and rack-scale systems. Testing is performed across the full product lifecycle, including manufacturing, and deployed field environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
